  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "淨零排放路徑管理與碳盤查",
    "sub_ename": "MANAGEMENT FOR NET ZERO EMISSION PATHWAY AND THE CARBON FOOTPRINT VERIFICATION",
    "describe_ch": "此課程將帶引學生探討不同產業的淨零排放路徑規劃，，藉由碳盤查診斷排放量與熱點鑑源，研析淨零排放路徑管理方式，達成減碳成效並且探討其對國家、產業、企業乃至個人的影響，進而有助減少溫室氣體排放，達到淨零轉型的關鍵目標。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to let students learn Net-zero emission pathway planning will affect the nation, industry, businesses, and even individuals. Reducing greenhouse gas emissions is a key goal of the net-zero transition. This course will guide students to analyze net-zero emission pathway management methods which is based on carbon footprint verification. Through diagnosis of emissions and hotspot identification achieve carbon reduction results.",
